---
import '../../styles/global.css';
---

<section id="timeline" class="timeline-section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-heading"><span>02.</span> Learning Trajectory</h2>
            <div class="timeline-container">
                
                <div class="timeline-item">
                    <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
                    <div class="timeline-date">Present</div>
                    <div class="timeline-content">
                        <h3>Kernel & Low-Level Exploitation</h3>
                        <p>Currently researching Windows and linux drivers at a lower level and diving deep into Kernel exploitation, IOCTL, and Native APIs.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="timeline-item">
                    <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
                    <div class="timeline-date">2025</div>
                    <div class="timeline-content">
                        <h3>Reverse Engineering & Linux</h3>
                        <p>Switched completely to Linux (Kali and later Arch). Completed a Research Internship at VJTI in Reverse Engineering and built a web server entirely in x86 Assembly. Mastered tools like Ghidra and IDA.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="timeline-item">
                    <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
                    <div class="timeline-date">2024</div>
                    <div class="timeline-content">
                        <h3>Cybersecurity & Networks</h3>
                        <p>Familiarized myself with network hacking tools like Scapy, tshark, and Netcat. Gained certifications in Cryptography, Hashing, and Ethical Hacking via Udemy.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="timeline-item">
                    <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
                    <div class="timeline-date">2023</div>
                    <div class="timeline-content">
                        <h3>Foundations & Web Dev</h3>
                        <p>Started delving into computers and programming. Became a Certified Developer in JavaScript, HTML, and CSS. Developed a strong grasp of C programming and Cookie Management.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </section>